# Site URL - update this for production
SITE_URL=https://www.panditjeehomepuja.in

# Google verification code (optional - update after setting up Google Search Console)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_VERIFICATION=your-verification-code

# Google Places API key (server-side only — do NOT prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_).
# Used by src/lib/googleReviews.ts to fetch live reviews + the aggregate
# rating from the Google Business Profile (Pandit ji Yash Shastri Home Puja,
# Mehrauli) for the homepage ReviewsSection and the site-wide ReviewWidget.
#
# The Place ID is fixed in SITE_CONFIG.googlePlaceId
# (ChIJK-XqUmsfDTkRHxoTZMC5roE), so only this key is needed at runtime.
#
# Required: enable "Places API (New)" in Google Cloud Console.
# Restrict the key: API restrictions = Places API only, Application
# restriction = IP addresses (Vercel build IPs) recommended.
#
# If unset or the fetch fails, reviews fall back to the static REVIEWS list
# in src/lib/constants.ts and the AggregateRating schema is omitted.
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=
